# MASTER DEVELOPMENT PROMPT
# ZOMBIE OUTBREAK – BIFEST Browser Game

## 1. ROLE & OBJECTIVE

Act as a Senior Game Developer, Three.js Engineer, Computer Vision Engineer, and UI/UX Designer.

Your task is to build a complete, playable, browser-based 3D zombie shooting game called **Zombie Outbreak**.

This game will be demonstrated at a BIFEST exhibition booth. Visitors should be able to walk up to a computer, enable the webcam, use body movements to aim and shoot zombies, complete missions, and progress through multiple stages.

This is not a static website or a visual prototype. Build an actual playable game with functional gameplay, computer vision controls, original sound effects, game state management, and replaceable assets.

Do not stop after creating the project structure. Implement, test, debug, and complete the MVP.

